# Voice stealing: eight synth voices for all the tracks. A long note held on a mono track (T2) keeps
# its voice when two chord tracks (T1, T3) ask for more than are left: a chord loses a note first
wait 300
settp 2 VOICES 0
turn ALGO -20
turn ALGO 1
wait 50
key 0 down
wait 200
turn ALGO -1
wait 50
key 2 down
key 4 down
key 6 down
key 7 down
wait 200
turn ALGO 2
wait 50
key 9 down
key 11 down
key 12 down
key 14 down
wait 200
expect held 2 1
expect held 1 3
expect held 3 4
key 0 up
key 2 up
key 4 up
key 6 up
key 7 up
key 9 up
key 11 up
key 12 up
key 14 up
